      en: ["Main export port of the Orungu Kingdom", "Center of the slave trade until approximately 1870", "First European contact by Portuguese (Lopes Gonçalves)", "Site of a 1911 lighthouse designed by Gustave Eiffel's office", "Geographical turning point between the Gulf of Guinea and the South Atlantic", "Today a major center of the Gabonese oil industry"],
